"the-maze-survivor-the-9th-entrants", "storyline": "A mysterious entity known as \"The Copyist\" has created an endless maze to test humanity\u2019s soul. Stripped of their memories, people from different places and times awaken in a walled clearing, surrounded by towering stone walls and a single mysterious opening.\n\nEach day, the maze shifts. Each night, horrors awaken. Survivors begin to realize that escape is not just about surviving monsters, but understanding why they were chosen\u2014and who is watching them.\n\nAs more people enter, twisted factions emerge, monsters take on human forms, and the maze reveals that it is not just a prison\u2014but a stage for a terrible experiment.", "summary": "The Maze Survivor: The 9th Entrants is a limited space survival game that uniquely combines the characteristics of survival, horror, puzzle solving and maze adventure games. Players will wake up in the center of a complex maze without any clues. Let's try to see if they can survive and escape from this strange maze.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 19, "name": "Horror"}, {"id": 21, "name": "Survival"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/the-maze-survivor-the-9th-entrants", "videos": [{"id": 155379, "name": "Gameplay Video", "video_id": "7ARvRXmTlyg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7ARvRXmTlyg", "title": "The Maze Survivor: 9th Entrants \u2013 Updated Gameplay Overview", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/7ARvRXmTlyg/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 155380, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "-1Z8qZLphLA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-1Z8qZLphLA", "title": "Multiplayer+Survival+Horror [Uncanny Labyrinth:The 9th Entrants] PV", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/-1Z8qZLphLA/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}